From 9bc1df81e13dc1fc3419f0cd09ed148057fb59c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yaroslav Zviezda <acroreiser@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Dec 2021 11:41:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: allow su domain in user builds

Do not use for anything except boot time one shot scripts.

Change-Id: I3ac61e9e3e9741d512ece95c86a8e7ee1617a926

Update the Android 17 policy snapshot (202604); API 30.0 has been removed upstream.
---
 build/soong/policy.go                |  4 ++--
 prebuilts/api/202404/private/init.te | 10 +++++-----
 prebuilts/api/202404/private/su.te   |  2 --
 prebuilts/api/202504/private/init.te |  3 +--
 prebuilts/api/202504/private/su.te   |  2 --
 prebuilts/api/202604/private/init.te |  3 ++-
 prebuilts/api/202604/private/su.te   |  2 --
